      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "Outdoor_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ahh... It feels great to be outside. Stardew Valley really is the most beautiful place...",
      "translation": "Ach... Venku je nádherně. Údolí Stardew je opravdu to nejkrásnější místo...",
