    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "summer_27",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Aw... summer's almost gone. My muscles are starting to deflate...$s",
      "translation": "Ach jo... Léto je skoro pryč. Začínají mi ochabovat svaly...$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "6708fa070c3cb88679398990778338a8b309366edf66fbcc64dfa00376d5ac65",
      "translationSHA256": "c87f27282f083a8827159747c34a78d783359887e9d21a406824700e57319268",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "fall_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Well, summer's over... but I'm going to stay positive. The warmer seasons will always return.",
      "translation": "Tak, léto skončilo... Ale budu myslet pozitivně. Teplá roční období se vždycky vrátí.",
      "sourceSHA256": "0117ca3fd54fa84eb8ffe4e77df45656ee4ac64994aac41d075dd68a8d5210ac",
      "translationSHA256": "9265f940e34df92dee5694f5ec0df4791cd468dfe18d27776e91e8fd2425d5df",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "fall_15",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Tomorrow's the fair, are we going to go?#$e#I don't care one way or another.",
      "translation": "Zítra je Jarmark údolí Stardew. Půjdeme tam?#$e#Mně je to jedno.",
      "sourceSHA256": "4828dfd6a1ec7e78bd90ee8786dd378577dc197a591775782927a9d255e64b09",
      "translationSHA256": "51c774838f3c6c10c278e8b1125e98188309a47b68e36b7d3ef48441d83d3b06",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "fall_26",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I hope my grandparents are doing okay. Grandpa's too cheap to turn on the furnace until the last minute.",
      "translation": "Doufám, že jsou prarodiče v pořádku. Děda je příliš lakomý na to, aby zapnul topení dřív než na poslední chvíli.",
      "sourceSHA256": "9137194ee64bae3d5e43f8fe897c6a6135f008243065f0ceeb3811e1dbc195a9",
      "translationSHA256": "53fbb1e1658789cc56e956a31006e4901b3d44d063041a81727e32964d316fde",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "winter_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Make sure you stay warm this winter. I worry about your delicate skin.",
      "translation": "Dávej pozor, ať ti letos v zimě není zima. Mám strach o tvou citlivou pokožku.",
      "sourceSHA256": "34afb41b577e5a266355f3b6897c2dc49f0b91086b68af56531697d4886b7a6a",
      "translationSHA256": "b7d59ac8a0225bc17961be48c20535b514d248ab0b6d1f460accdfc090769eba",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAlex",
      "key": "winter_7",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Are you going to enter the fishing contest tomorrow? I think you can win it!",
      "translation": "Zúčastníš se zítra rybářské soutěže? Myslím, že můžeš vyhrát!",
      "sourceSHA256": "3f453d2e4a26e3130213b821d98f06fc51749d4499db76adfc8f09b4050dceba",
      "translationSHA256": "a95352d4c9ffbc46f64aba932d450b3108a74f315a98623499521d4409511dd9",
      "reviewChecks": [
